<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Genset raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Genset raised.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist raised its rating on shares of drug maker Genset to strong buy from buy following the company's signing of a deal with Abbott Laboratories Inc.</p>
<p>-- said the deal provides excellent cash flow to Genset over the next two years.</p>
<p>-- said the deal acts as a technical platform from which to market itself to other pharmaceutical companies.</p>
<p>-- the deal calls for Abbott and Genset to collaborate in the pharmacogenomics, which is the study of how different populations respond to drug therapies.</p>
</text>
